<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000001LH100KX" category="J" type-id="801ER" name-id="261N9-01" from="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Paddle Shift Switch Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001LH100KX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000GXB00001">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When the shift lever is in the M position, any gear can be selected using the transmission shift switch on the steering assembly. Also, while driving in the D position, the system changes to range selection in the D position and any shift position can be selected.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LH100KX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000GXC00001">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C217551J01" width="7.106578999in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LH100KX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LH100KX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001LH100KX_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000GXE00001">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (Sport Shift UP SW / Sport Shift DOWN SW)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the screen display to display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen and check the computer data when the transmission shift switch on the steering assembly is operated to +/-.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>[Diagnosis menu screen: Powertrain → ECT → ECU Data Monitor]</title>
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.84in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
<ptxt>[Symbol]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Description/Display Range</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard Value</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Remarks</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Sport Shift UP SW</ptxt>
<ptxt>[UPS]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Indicates transmission control switch (+)</ptxt>
<ptxt>Display: ON/OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>OFF→ON:</ptxt>
<ptxt>Shift switch "+" lever released → pulled</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Transmission control switch (SFTU) signal</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Sport Shift DOWN SW</ptxt>
<ptxt>[DWNS]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Indicates transmission control switch (-)</ptxt>
<ptxt>Display: ON/OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>OFF→ON:</ptxt>
<ptxt>Shift switch "-" lever released → pulled</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Transmission control switch (SFTD) signal</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001LH100KX_04_0008" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001LH100KX_04_0004" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
