<testgrp id="RM000001LH100KX_04_0016" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IM400000">
<testtitle>Inspect Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the spiral cable sub-assembly.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the spiral cable sub-assembly removal procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000QFH008X"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable sub-assembly to the center position.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFE009X_02_0046"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals under the following conditions.</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>After setting the spiral cable sub-assembly to the center position, perform the inspection at the positions turned 2.5 turns clockwise and 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable sub-assembly to the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and perform the inspection while turning it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C175193J03" width="2.775699831in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="1.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.16in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.11in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A6 (ECC) - C2 (ECC)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A2 (SFTU) - C9 (SUP)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A3 (SFTD) - C10 (SDN)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not turn the spiral cable sub-assembly more than the specified number of turns, as the cable may break.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" align="center" colwidth="0.33in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" align="left" colwidth="3.80in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>*1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Connector Disconnected</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Spiral Cable Sub-assembly)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<test1>
<ptxt>Install the spiral cable sub-assembly.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the spiral cable sub-assembly installation procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000000QFE009X"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001LH100KX_04_0014" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001LH100KX_04_0017" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
